pending chart per user."}, {"id": "D15", "text": "Make every panel respect a month range filter and a city filter."}, {"id": "D9", "text": "A Food Delivery and Quick Commerce trend by month with October and November highlighted."}]}, {"key": "documentation", "title": "Phase 4, Documentation", "tasks": [{"id": "DOC1", "text": "Write a short write-up with three sections: (1) **Process Flow**: how you turned five bank formats into one table, including duplicates, failed payments and merchant aliases; (2) **Key Discoveries**: 3 to 5 findings about where the cohort's salary goes; (3) **Advice**: a one page money plan for Komal for next year, with rupee targets taken from their own data."}]}, {"key": "stretch", "title": "Stretch ideas (optional)", "tasks": [{"id": "X-S5", "text": "Who pays for friends more than friends pay them back? Net peer transfers per user."}, {"id": "X-S4", "text": "Build a simple rule that predicts a broke day from the first 10 days of a month, and test it."}, {"id": "X-S3", "text": "Does a salary hike change spending? Compare the three months before and after for the users who got one."}]}], "brief": "**Your personal brief:** your person is **U11 (Komal)** and your focus month is **February 2026**."}$pack$::jsonb
