with October and November highlighted."}, {"id": "D14", "text": "A merchant alias table: every raw name you mapped to each brand."}, {"id": "D8", "text": "A month by user heatmap of savings rate, so the bad months are obvious."}]}, {"key": "documentation", "title": "Phase 4, Documentation", "tasks": [{"id": "DOC1", "text": "Write a short write-up with three sections: (1) **Process Flow**: how you turned five bank formats into one table, including duplicates, failed payments and merchant aliases; (2) **Key Discoveries**: 3 to 5 findings about where the cohort's salary goes; (3) **Advice**: a one page money plan for Anjali for next year, with rupee targets taken from their own data."}]}, {"key": "stretch", "title": "Stretch ideas (optional)", "tasks": [{"id": "X-S1", "text": "Design a monthly budget for Anjali that would have kept them above ₹2,000 every day, and show which categories pay for it."}, {"id": "X-S3", "text": "Does a salary hike change spending? Compare the three months before and after for the users who got one."}, {"id": "X-S6", "text": "Write the app's improved auto-categoriser as a rule table and report its accuracy against yours."}]}], "brief": "**Your personal brief:** your person is **U05 (Anjali)** and your focus month is **June 2025**."}$pack$::jsonb
