", "text": "A month by user heatmap of savings rate, so the bad months are obvious."}, {"id": "D6", "text": "Cohort header: average savings rate, users spending more than they earn, total subscriptions cost and double charges."}]}, {"key": "documentation", "title": "Phase 4, Documentation", "tasks": [{"id": "DOC1", "text": "Write a short write-up with three sections: (1) **Process Flow**: how you turned five bank formats into one table, including duplicates, failed payments and merchant aliases; (2) **Key Discoveries**: 3 to 5 findings about where the cohort's salary goes; (3) **Advice**: a one page money plan for Aarav for next year, with rupee targets taken from their own data."}]}, {"key": "stretch", "title": "Stretch ideas (optional)", "tasks": [{"id": "X-S3", "text": "Does a salary hike change spending? Compare the three months before and after for the users who got one."}, {"id": "X-S5", "text": "Who pays for friends more than friends pay them back? Net peer transfers per user."}, {"id": "X-S1", "text": "Design a monthly budget for Aarav that would have kept them above ₹2,000 every day, and show which categories pay for it."}]}], "brief": "**Your personal brief:** your person is **U12 (Aarav)** and your focus month is **January 2026**."}$pack$::jsonb
