y raw name you mapped to each brand."}, {"id": "D13", "text": "An App_Category accuracy panel: blank and wrong shares by category."}, {"id": "D11", "text": "A city comparison: savings rate and rent share of income by city."}]}, {"key": "documentation", "title": "Phase 4, Documentation", "tasks": [{"id": "DOC1", "text": "Write a short write-up with three sections: (1) **Process Flow**: how you turned five bank formats into one table, including duplicates, failed payments and merchant aliases; (2) **Key Discoveries**: 3 to 5 findings about where the cohort's salary goes; (3) **Advice**: a one page money plan for Arjun for next year, with rupee targets taken from their own data."}]}, {"key": "stretch", "title": "Stretch ideas (optional)", "tasks": [{"id": "X-S6", "text": "Write the app's improved auto-categoriser as a rule table and report its accuracy against yours."}, {"id": "X-S5", "text": "Who pays for friends more than friends pay them back? Net peer transfers per user."}, {"id": "X-S2", "text": "Estimate how much the cohort would save in a year by cancelling every subscription used by fewer than half of its months of charges (you will need to define 'used')."}]}], "brief": "**Your personal brief:** your person is **U09 (Arjun)** and your focus month is **March 2026**."}$pack$::jsonb
